Meeting summary for 10 December 2025:

  *

    *New: cancelled meetings*
    On December 24 and December 31 there will be no community meetings,
    for obvious reasons.

  *

    *Updated: Release 2.7*
    We have a new signing key so we are unblocked for further releases.
    Tentatively an rc4 will be coming on December 17. And followed by
    stable tentatively on January 14.

  *

    *Updated: 2.7 security audit*
    There are still things ongoing in regards to the security audit but
    no new major findings so far.
    Still have items to review and go through, but this is ongoing.

  *

    *Updated: forums situation*
    Currently website team from OpenVPN Inc is looking further into a
    migration to a new forum platform.
    Question was raised what to do with forum avatars - suggested to
    just not migrate those as being irrelevant.
    Current estimate is being able to switch to new forums in Q1 2026
    somewhere.

As always you're welcome to join at #openvpn-meeting on Libera IRC 
network every Wednesday at 14:00 Central European Time.

Kind regards,
Johan Draaisma

